OpenXR hand subaction paths

Files:
  alvr/client_openxr/src/interaction.rs
  alvr/client_openxr/src/stream.rs
  alvr/client_openxr/src/lib.rs

Purpose:
  Declare each hand action with its /user/hand/{left,right} subaction path and use that path for action state, spaces, buttons, and haptics. This removes the XR_ERROR_PATH_UNSUPPORTED loop emitted by QXR when ALVR queried hand actions with XR_NULL_PATH.

Build:
  cargo xtask build-client

